  "revised_conclusions": [
    "Keyframe time stretching narrowed from a generic low-cost alternative to a creative candidate with measurable unity reconstruction colour and weak solo-vocal evidence.",
    "The favourable keyframe transient result at 1.8 expansion does not transfer to 0.5 compression.",
    "Isolated RTF is no longer accepted as a deployment gate; target-host tail callback timing, xruns and asynchronous underruns are required.",
    "BNNSGraph's strong result is bounded to the tested architecture, sizes, M3 host and session, not a universal backend ranking."
  ],
